rt, the entire hole COLLAPSED.\n\nNow, you and your rat colony are stuck underground and are tasked with finding a way out of the underground. Finding your home again won't be easy, but you are responsible for the freedom of your entire colony.\n\n\n\nFind your way, and pray you will make it out alive.\n", "short_description": "Previously, the rats had dug a hole in the ground in search of riches, but they found something much more peculiar.\n\nBut when one careless rat hit his head on some dirt, the entire hole COLLAPSED.\n\nNow, you and your rat colony is stuck underground and are tasked with finding a way out of the underground. Finding your home again won't be easy, but you are responsible for the freedom of your entire colony.\n\n\n\nFind your way, and pray you will make it out alive.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/scaredyrat/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "LPorsomething", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/scaredyrat/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "26354167777521686"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392185_668660015519763_4211597424270513934_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&